title: Genesis 20 – Abraham and Abimelech
description: A verse-by-verse study of Genesis 20: Abraham again says of Sarah, She is my sister, God warns Abimelech in a dream, the half-truth of the half-sister, and the lesson that the father of the faithful struggled with fear and sin as we do.
output: lessons/genesis/genesis-20-abraham-and-abimelech.html
context: Genesis 20

# Genesis series pattern (Genesis 1-5). Slide text is the author's own sentences from the Genesis 20 study (posts
